[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3456546748","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112120#issuecomment-3456546748","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112120","id":3456546748,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OBre8","user":{"login":"ttencate","id":90930,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90930?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate","html_url":"https://github.com/ttencate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-28T13:44:07Z","updated_at":"2025-10-28T13:44:07Z","body":"> Does this really solve the issue at hand? It still doesn't quite explain \"how to use it\", but it is a much better description of how it actually works.\r\n\r\nRemoved the \"fixed\".","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3456546748/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3460255121","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112120#issuecomment-3460255121","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112120","id":3460255121,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OP02R","user":{"login":"ttencate","id":90930,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90930?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate","html_url":"https://github.com/ttencate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T07:57:38Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T07:57:38Z","body":"Oh, I don't want this to block the PR, so I've changed it back to \"heightmap\". The rest of the docs are also leaning towards this:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ ag -c height.map\r\nResourceImporterOBJ.xml:1\r\nResourceImporterScene.xml:1\r\nBaseMaterial3D.xml:9\r\n\r\n$ ag -c heightmap\r\nShape3D.xml:1\r\nGPUParticlesCollisionHeightField3D.xml:19\r\nPhysicsRayQueryParameters3D.xml:2\r\nHeightMapShape3D.xml:20\r\nPhysicsServer3DExtension.xml:1\r\nRayCast3D.xml:2\r\nBaseMaterial3D.xml:51\r\nPhysicsServer3D.xml:7\r\nProjectSettings.xml:2\r\nRenderingServer.xml:1\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf this is the blessed spelling, I'll send another PR to update the rest.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3460255121/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3460652109","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112120#issuecomment-3460652109","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112120","id":3460652109,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ORVxN","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T09:53:07Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T09:53:07Z","body":"> The rest of the docs are also leaning towards this:\r\n\r\nNote that your search also includes names for properties and methods (that always contain `heightmap`), but even not accounting for them it's still the majority. With these odd spelling cases I personally am more concerned with consistency _at least_ within the same class reference page.\r\n\r\n> If this is the blessed spelling, I'll send another PR to update the rest.\r\n\r\nJust in case someone tries to actually address these: there's a lot of spelling inconsistencies across the documentation, but changing them would make a lot of noise, invalidate translations in a way that is very difficult to troubleshoot[^1], and they may present themselves again due to differing opinions. Tread carefully and avoid changing descriptions if they don't contain other problems, as well.\r\n\r\n[^1]: When updating localizations on Weblate, if an English string is _similar enough_ to an old one, all corresponding translated strings are \"marked for edit\". Small changes like these are really difficult to spot, especially for really long descriptions, and they often do not even affect the actual translation (meaning there's nothing to edit in practice).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3460652109/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3460713441","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112120#issuecomment-3460713441","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112120","id":3460713441,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ORkvh","user":{"login":"ttencate","id":90930,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90930?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate","html_url":"https://github.com/ttencate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"p